  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After soul searching Xia Cha, Xia clan’s first supreme elder, Fang Yuan plunders her immortal killer moves. She had built two sets around Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter Immortal Gu; the battle set is spring scissors, summer fan, autumn perception, and winter coat. Autumn perception fills a gap in investigation for him, while winter coat is defense and the first two are ferocious offense that show rank eight might. A second set, spring ploughing, summer hoeing, autumn harvest, and winter storage, serves immortal aperture management instead of battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1617
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xia_cha",
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When three Immortal Gu Houses close in and attack from afar, Fang Yuan uses autumn perception so that eyes seem to grow on his back, and he dodges their strikes. When he cannot dodge, he falls back on winter coat, which is amplified in the River of Time with his time path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1633
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-chase",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "path_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long judges Fang Yuan’s time path combat system the most complete of his styles, listing autumn perception with spring scissors, summer fan, winter coat, year beast summoning, Myriad Year Flying Warship, and related aperture-management moves among its methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
